          "scope_and_question": "The review examines the 2025 Marburg virus disease (MVD) outbreak in Ethiopia, focusing on molecular determinants of virulence, epidemiological patterns, and public health responses. The central question addresses the interplay between zoonotic spillover, human transmission dynamics, and healthcare system preparedness in a resource-limited setting.",
          "evidence_base_and_review_method": "This review synthesizes evidence from the 2025 Ethiopian Marburg outbreak, including molecular sequencing, contact tracing, and public health response data. The review highlights the rapid confirmation of cases within 48 hours, >90% contact tracing, and same-day L-gene sequencing.",
